== ui_card "Toggle Panel Helper"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_toggle_panel(title, position: :left, &block)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Progressive disclosure is key to simple interfaces. The <code>ui_toggle_panel</code> helper uses native web standards to hide complexity until needed.
  ul
    li <strong>Native:</strong> Uses <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code> for free accessibility.
    li <strong>Clean:</strong> Removes the need for complex JavaScript accordions.

  h3 Arguments
  table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem;"
    thead style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sp-border);"
      tr
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Name
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Type
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Description
    tbody
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" title
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String/HTML
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The text or HTML to display in the summary line.
      tr
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" block
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Block
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The hidden content.

  h3 Real World Scenarios
  
  h4 1. Advanced Settings
  p Hide advanced options to keep the UI clean.
  
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_toggle_panel "Advanced Settings" do
        p API Key: *****
        p Region: US-East-1
      
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code
          | == ui_toggle_panel "Advanced Settings" do
              ...content...
